    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've heard the \"reach out\" stuff a thousand times. it's just a script, isn't it? even if i talk to someone, what changes? the reality is that i don't have a role anymore. i don't contribute anything. i'm just this heavy, empty weight that people have to deal with. it feels like the natural order of things is that once you're done, you just... exit. doesn't it feel a bit absurd to keep forcing yourself to exist when there's literally nothing left to be?",
